[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0631","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0631.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55667","title":"File Browser 路径遍历任意文件删除漏洞","description":"tags asrequested.<value>File Browser 是一个用于上传、删除、预览、重命名和编辑指定目录内文件的文件管理界面。在 2.63.16 版本之前，仅拥有 Create 权限的作用域非管理员用户可通过上传失败清理路径中的符号链接跟随漏洞，删除其作用域之外的任意文件（包括其他租户数据和应用程序自身数据库）。ScopedFs.RemoveAll 是唯一跳过其他方法强制执行的符号链接守卫的解引用操作。直接上传处理器在失败清理期间对用户控制的路径执行 RemoveAll，仅受 Perm.Create 门控。如果用户作用域内已存在逃逸目录符号链接，经过身份验证的仅创建权限用户可删除作用域外目标，绕过 ScopedFs 边界和 Perm.Delete 门控。该漏洞是对 CVE-2026-54094 的不完整修复，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。官方已在 2.63.16 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55667","GHSA-fmm7-x4gx-8jhr"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T19:16:43Z","updated":"2026-06-26T04:17:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 File Browser 至 v2.63.16 或更高版本，该版本在 ScopedFs.Remove 和 ScopedFs.RemoveAll 方法中增加了 symlink 路径解析守卫（guard），防止上传失败清理时沿符号链接删除范围外文件。如无法立即升级，可临时移除用户作用域内所有非预期的符号链接，并监控 /api/resources 路径的 POST 请求日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/security/advisories/GHSA-fmm7-x4gx-8jhr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55667.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2026/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-556xx/CVE-2026-55667.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55667.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0631.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0631.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0508","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54250","title":"K3s etcd 快照解压 ZIP 路径遍历漏洞","description":"K3s 的 etcd 快照解压功能存在 ZIP 存档路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意文件名（如 `../../../../etc/password`）的 ZIP 存档，当管理员使用 `--cluster-reset --cluster-reset-restore-path` 恢复该压缩快照时，存档中的文件会被解压写入到文件系统的任意位置，导致任意文件写入。该漏洞需管理员手动触发恢复操作且需高权限，CVSS 评分 5.8，影响 K3s 1.35.3+k3s1、1.34.6+k3s1、v1.33.10+k3s1 之前版本。修复方式为升级至上述安全版本或启用 Go 内置的不安全路径保护机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54250","GHSA-jxr7-mqhw-9p98"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T19:16:41Z","updated":"2026-06-26T19:16:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 K3s 至 v1.35.3+k3s1、v1.34.6+k3s1 或 v1.33.10+k3s1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，恢复 etcd 快照时设置环境变量 `GODEBUG=zipinsecurepath=0` 启用 Go 内置的不安全路径保护，或手动从 ZIP 中解压快照文件后再恢复（确保快照文件不以 .zip 结尾）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/security/advisories/GHSA-jxr7-mqhw-9p98","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54250.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54250.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/k3s-io/k3s/CVE-2026-54250.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54250.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54250.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5973.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-jxr7-mqhw-9p98/GHSA-jxr7-mqhw-9p98.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54250.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/tooming/k8s-anywhere/blob/cb260561de09e80262f7a67cf31cef0ce821b55f/ROADMAP.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0483","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0483.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54089","title":"File Browser 代理认证标头伪造身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"File Browser 是一款文件管理界面，当配置代理认证模式（auth.method=proxy）时，其 ProxyAuth.Auth() 函数无条件信任 HTTP 请求头中的用户标识字段（如 X-Remote-User），未对请求来源 IP 进行任何校验，也未验证共享密钥或签名。未经身份认证的远程攻击者若可直接访问 FileBrowser 实例（如 Docker 默认将端口暴露至 0.0.0.0），只需发送一个伪造的 HTTP 请求头即可冒充任意用户（包括管理员）获取有效 JWT 令牌，从而完全接管服务器。此外，若指定的用户名不存在，服务器会自动创建新用户账户，提供无授权的账户注册能力。该漏洞影响所有支持 proxy 认证模式的版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54089","GHSA-xqp3-jq6g-x3qm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T19:16:40Z","updated":"2026-06-25T19:58:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 FileBrowser 至包含修复的最新版本；如无法升级，将 `auth.method` 从 `proxy` 改为 `json` 并配置反向代理处理认证。确保 FileBrowser 绑定到 `127.0.0.1` 或通过防火墙限制仅允许反向代理 IP 访问，禁止直接暴露端口到不可信网络。在反向代理层配置规则，强制覆盖或删除 `X-Remote-User` 等认证头，防止客户端伪造。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/blob/main/auth/proxy.go","https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/blob/main/http/auth.go#L121-L137","https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/security/advisories/GHSA-xqp3-jq6g-x3qm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54089.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54089.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54089.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54089.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/v2/CVE-2026-54089.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54089.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5966.yaml","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54089-file-browser-authentication-bypass-via-proxy-auth-header-forgery.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54089.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-xqp3-jq6g-x3qm/GHSA-xqp3-jq6g-x3qm.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0483.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0480","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54088","title":"File Browser Hook认证功能命令注入导致预认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"File Browser 是一款用于管理指定目录内文件上传、删除、预览、重命名和编辑的文件管理界面。其 Hook Authentication（钩子认证）功能允许管理员将登录验证委托给外部 shell 命令执行，但该功能在 2.63.6 之前版本中存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。用户提交的用户名和密码通过 `os.Expand` 直接拼接到 shell 命令字符串中，未进行任何转义或过滤处理。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在登录页面的用户名或密码字段中注入 shell 元字符（如 `;`、`#` 等），导致服务器在认证前即执行任意操作系统命令，实现预认证远程代码执行。攻击者无需任何有效账户或凭证，仅需发送单个特制 HTTP 请求即可完成利用，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54088","GHSA-m93h-4hw7-5qcm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T19:16:40Z","updated":"2026-06-25T19:58:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 File Browser 至 2.63.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `os.Expand` 未转义导致的命令注入问题。如无法立即升级，应禁用 Hook Authentication 功能（在配置文件中移除或注释相关 hook 命令配置），并在网络层面限制对 File Browser 登录端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/security/advisories/GHSA-m93h-4hw7-5qcm","https://github.com/Saku0512/CVE-2026-54088-poc","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2026/CVE-2026-54088.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54088.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54088.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54088.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/v2/CVE-2026-54088.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54088/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54088.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5962.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54088.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54088-file-browser-command-injection-via-authentication-hook-shell-substitution-pre-authentication-rce.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0480.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0480.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0480.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0472","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0472.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-12921","title":"AzeoTech DAQFactory 释放后使用代码执行漏洞","description":"AzeoTech DAQFactory 软件存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，影响 21.1 及更早版本。该漏洞的成因在于程序处理 .ctl 配置文件时，未正确管理已释放内存对象的引用，导致攻击者可构造特殊的 .ctl 文件触发释放后使用条件。攻击者需诱骗用户打开恶意构造的 .ctl 文件，利用释放后内存的重新占用实现任意代码执行。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为 8.4（高危），成功利用可导致受影响系统被完全控制，造成数据泄露、系统破坏或进一步横向渗透。AzeoTech DAQFactory 广泛应用于工业数据采集与控制场景，攻击面涉及关键基础设施环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-12921"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-25T19:16:36Z","updated":"2026-07-16T15:50:47Z","remediation":"立即将 AzeoTech DAQFactory 升级至 21.1 之后的最新版本，厂商已发布修复更新。如暂时无法升级，请采取以下缓解措施：仅从可信来源获取 .ctl 文件，将 .ctl 文件存放于仅管理员可写入的目录中，在加载不受信任的文档时启用\"Safe Mode\"运行模式，并为文档设置编辑密码以防止恶意篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-169-02","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12921.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_3_CVE-2026-12921.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12921.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-12921.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-12921.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-3mp5-47hq-xq78/GHSA-3mp5-47hq-xq78.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/89855f80c8f178ff839b6fc9371fb9797823d7a8/reports/2026/07/intel--1784857054_CVE-2026-12921_CVE-2026-16804_CVE-2026-2.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-12921.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2026/07/2026-07-24-report.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-06-28_11-12-48.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0472.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0519","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54448","title":"Aqua Security Trivy Helm 图表解压拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trivy 安全扫描器在处理 Helm 图表归档文件（.tgz）时，其自定义 tar 解包器使用无大小限制的 io.ReadAll 读取每个条目，存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可将恶意构造的 .tgz 文件放置在 Trivy 扫描路径中，利用 tar 炸弹技术使小体积压缩包解压后膨胀至数 GB，导致 Trivy 进程被操作系统 OOM killer 终止。该漏洞影响 trivy config、trivy filesystem --scanners misconf 及 trivy image --scanners misconf 等扫描模式，在 CI/CD 流水线场景中尤为危险——攻击者可通过提交包含恶意 Helm chart 的 PR 触发扫描失败、流水线阻塞，并可能消耗云 CI 运行器额外资源。已在 Trivy v0.71.0 中修复，使用 helm.sh/helm/v4 SDK 的 archive.LoadArchiveFiles 替代自定义解包器，强制实施条目级和总大小限制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54448","GHSA-q3fv-x8vg-qqm4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T17:16:41Z","updated":"2026-06-26T19:27:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Trivy 至 v0.71.0 或更高版本，该版本使用 helm.sh/helm/v4 SDK 的 archive.LoadArchiveFiles 替代了无大小限制的自定义 tar 解包器。如无法立即升级，可通过 cgroup/容器限制 Trivy 进程内存上限，或使用 --skip-dirs 排除包含不可信 Helm Chart 归档文件的目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/pull/10718","https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/security/advisories/GHSA-q3fv-x8vg-qqm4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54448.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54448.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/CVE-2026-54448.yml","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/9c6fab3ea174ce6e30d3e56324f3569eab03a80d/osv/trivy/CVE-2026-54448.json.sha256","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54448.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54448.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0bde7ad241dd0e070c73be268acb78555be38fd9/posts/cve-2026-54448-go-github-com-aquasecurity-trivy.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54448.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/t/trivy/.rev","https://github.com/vergil-project/vergil-containers/blob/a022bcd48b8ceaadea6a387b692cc7d8ebb58ebc/releases/v2.1.11.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0098","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54822","title":"WordPress SALESmanago & Leadoo 插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"WordPress SALESmanago 及 Leadoo 插件存在 SQL 注入漏洞，版本 3.11.2 及以下中未对用户输入进行充分过滤，经身份认证的订阅者权限攻击者可通过向插件相关参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，进而实现数据库信息窃取、数据篡改或获取更高权限。该漏洞影响大量使用该插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。厂商已在 3.11.3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54822"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-25T14:16:46Z","updated":"2026-06-25T16:16:39Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress SALESmanago 与 Leadoo 插件升级至 3.11.3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则拦截包含 SQL 注入特征的请求参数，并限制 WordPress 站点仅允许受信任用户注册订阅者账号，同时禁用未使用的用户注册功能以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/salesmanago/vulnerability/wordpress-salesmanago-leadoo-plugin-3-11-2-sql-injection-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54822.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54822-salesmanago-292dab09-7090-4ca9-bca2-0d3e6db08818.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54822.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54822/README.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54822.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54822.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54822.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_SALESmanago_and_Leadoo%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6_SQL%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54822.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54822.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/a216efd008f5f915e27ab611087fc46ed0826190/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-06-28_11-12-48.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54822"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0098.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0240","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13311","title":"shell-quote parse 函数二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"shell-quote 包 1.8.5 之前版本的 `parse()` 函数在 token 归约阶段使用 `Array.prototype.concat` 作为累加器，每次迭代都会复制整个增长的数组，导致解析时间复杂度达到 O(n²)。未认证的远程攻击者只需向调用 `parse()` 的代码路径提交一段普通空格分隔字符串（无需 shell 元字符），即可阻塞 Node.js 单线程事件循环长达数十秒，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞仅影响可用性，不涉及代码执行或数据泄露，修复版本为 1.8.5。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13311","GHSA-395f-4hp3-45gv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T05:16:52Z","updated":"2026-06-26T19:03:34Z","remediation":"立即将 shell-quote 升级至 1.8.5 及以上版本：npm install shell-quote@^1.8.5。如无法立即升级，可在调用 parse() 前限制输入字符串长度（如不超过 1000 字符）或对输入进行 token 数量截断作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/security/advisories/GHSA-395f-4hp3-45gv","https://www.npmjs.com/package/shell-quote","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-13311.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13311.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-13311.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_3_CVE-2026-13311.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/shell-quote/CVE-2026-13311.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-13311","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13311.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13311.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/74014ddcba92a88bf146c7d5216ff151aea7811e/app/routes/posts/2026-06-25_CVE-2026-13311.mdx","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-13311.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0240.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0489","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54158","title":"SiYuan 思源笔记 属性视图存储型XSS到远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SiYuan（思源笔记）开源知识管理系统 3.7.0 之前版本中，属性视图（数据库）单元格渲染器 genAVValueHTML 在 text、url、phone、mAsset 四个分支中未对单元格内容进行 HTML 转义处理。具有工作空间写入权限的攻击者可通过同步机制植入包含恶意载荷的单元格数据（如 `</textarea><img src=x onerror=\"...\">`），当受害者打开包含该行的块属性面板时，载荷突破标签边界执行任意 JavaScript。在 Electron 桌面端因启用 nodeIntegration:true，XSS 可链式升级为远程代码执行（RCE），通过 require('child_process') 执行系统命令。该漏洞 CVSS 9.9，危害等级严重，影响所有通过同步机制共享工作空间的用户，已在 3.7.0 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54158","GHSA-5xfx-xj4h-5p7r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-26T00:16:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 SiYuan 至 3.7.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 `genAVValueHTML` 中 text、url、phone、mAsset 四个分支的单元格内容进行 HTML 转义，阻止注入。可通过应用内\"设置→关于→检查更新\"或从官方 GitHub releases 页面下载最新安装包进行升级。升级前建议备份工作区目录（含 `data/storage/av/` 下的 AV 文件），清除已存在的恶意单元格数据。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层限制对 `/api/av/getAttributeView` 和 `/api/av/updateAttrViewCell` 接口的外部访问，仅允许可信客户端调用，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-5xfx-xj4h-5p7r","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54158.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54158.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54158.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54158.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-54158.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54158/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54158.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5957.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54158.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54158.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0489.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0489.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0467","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0467.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54070","title":"SiYuan Bazaar 市场软件包 README 存储型 XSS 漏洞","description":"SiYuan 是一款开源个人知识管理系统，其 Bazaar 插件市场的 README 渲染功能存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。漏洞根因在于 lute 引擎的 HTML 清理器采用事件处理器黑名单机制，仅拦截 w3schools 遗留列表中的旧式事件属性，而 `onpointerover`、`onpointerdown`、`onauxclick`、`onbeforetoggle`、`onfocusin`、`onanimationstart`、`ontransitionend` 等现代事件处理器未被列入黑名单，导致恶意 HTML 属性被原样通过。攻击者可在第三方插件包的 README.md 中嵌入上述事件处理器，当管理员在设置→市场中浏览该插件包并悬停或点击时，恶意 JavaScript 在管理员认证的 SiYuan 源站上下文中执行。前端通过 `innerHTML` 直接赋值渲染结果且未使用 DOMPurify 过滤，内核 HTTP 响应未设置 CSP 等安全头，进一步扩大了攻击面。攻击者可窃取内核 API Token，进而完全控制工作区。该漏洞影响 SiYuan ≤3.6.5 版本，已在 3.7.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54070","GHSA-w7cg-whh7-xp28"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-26T19:16:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 SiYuan 至 3.7.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 lute 引擎的 sanitizer 事件属性黑名单遗漏问题。如无法立即升级，管理员应避免在 Settings → Marketplace 中接受市场信任许可（bazaar.trust 保持默认 false），同时可在反向代理层添加 Content-Security-Policy: script-src 'self' 头作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-w7cg-whh7-xp28","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54070.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54070.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54070.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54070.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-54070.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54070.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5965.yaml","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54070-siyuan-stored-xss-in-bazaar-marketplace-via-package-readme-event-handlers.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54070.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54070.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0467.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0465","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0465.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54069","title":"SiYuan 思源笔记浏览器扩展 Origin 校验缺失漏洞","description":"SiYuan 是一款开源个人知识管理系统，其内核 HTTP 服务器在会话认证中间件中无条件信任所有 `chrome-extension://` 来源的请求，将任意浏览器扩展的请求赋予 `RoleAdministrator` 管理员角色权限。结合桌面版默认 `AccessAuthCode` 为空字符串的配置，任何已安装的 Chrome/Chromium 扩展（包括通过供应链攻击被攻陷的合法扩展）均可无需认证直接调用 `127.0.0.1:6806` 上的全部管理 API，实现工作区数据窃取、存储型 XSS 注入及配置篡改。该漏洞影响 SiYuan ≤ 3.6.5 版本，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重，已在 3.7.0 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54069","GHSA-hvr9-72v2-fff3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-25T15:16:38Z","remediation":"立即将 SiYuan 升级至 v3.7.0 或更高版本，该版本移除了对所有 chrome-extension:// Origin 的无条件信任，改为白名单验证机制。如暂时无法升级，可设置访问认证码：打开设置 → 关于 → 设置访问授权码（AccessAuthCode），使内核 API 要求 token 认证，阻止未授权扩展直接调用管理接口。同时建议审查已安装的浏览器扩展，移除不必要的或来源不明的扩展。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-hvr9-72v2-fff3","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-54069.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-54069.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54069.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54069.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54069.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54069.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-54069.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54069.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-5961.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54069-siyuan-unauthenticated-admin-api-access-via-blanket-chrome-extension-origin-allowlist.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-hvr9-72v2-fff3/GHSA-hvr9-72v2-fff3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0465.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0463","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0463.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54068","title":"SiYuan 动态图标接口未授权模板注入致SQLite数据泄露漏洞","description":"SiYuan 是一款开源个人知识管理系统，其 `/api/icon/getDynamicIcon` 接口在路由层被标记为\"不需要鉴权\"，未经验证即可访问。当攻击者传入 `type=8` 参数及有效的块 ID 时，该接口会调用 Go 模板渲染函数，其中注册了 `querySQL` 和 `queryBlocks` 两个模板函数，可对底层 SQLite 数据库执行任意 SELECT 查询。网络可达的未认证攻击者只需获取一个有效的块 ID（可通过共享文档链接、Referer 头或浏览器历史泄露），即可窃取所有笔记内容、标签、资源引用和块属性等敏感数据。该漏洞影响 SiYuan 3.7.0 之前所有版本，已在 3.7.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54068","GHSA-gcm7-57gf-953c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-25T14:16:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 SiYuan 至 v3.7.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /api/icon/getDynamicIcon 接口的模板注入问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截对 /api/icon/getDynamicIcon 的未授权访问，或限制 SiYuan 服务仅监听 127.0.0.1 而非 0.0.0.0，避免暴露到网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-gcm7-57gf-953c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54068.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54068.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54068.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-54068.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54068.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5958.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-gcm7-57gf-953c/GHSA-gcm7-57gf-953c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54068.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54068.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0463.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0461","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0461.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54067","title":"SiYuan 思源笔记 CSS 代码片段存储型XSS到远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SiYuan（思源笔记）是一款开源个人知识管理系统，其CSS代码片段功能存在存储型跨站脚本（Stored XSS）漏洞。当renderSnippet()通过insertAdjacentHTML将CSS片段内容插入<style>标签时，未对用户输入的</style>字符串进行转义处理，攻击者可在CSS片段中注入</style><img src=x onerror=\"...\">等恶意载荷，突破<style>标签上下文执行任意JavaScript代码。在Electron桌面版中，由于渲染进程启用了nodeIntegration:true，攻击者可进一步通过require('child_process')链式利用实现远程代码执行（RCE）。该漏洞影响SiYuan 3.7.0之前所有版本，CVSS评分9.9，危害等级严重。攻击者只需拥有工作区写入权限（如通过泄露的同步凭证、共享文件系统或多用户Docker服务器），即可植入恶意CSS片段，该片段会通过工作区同步机制传播至所有同步设备，在应用启动或刷新时自动触发，无需用户交互。官方已在3.7.0版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54067","GHSA-mvjr-vv3c-w4qv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-25T16:16:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 SiYuan 至 v3.7.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 CSS 代码片段通过 insertAdjacentHTML 插值导致的 XSS 到 RCE 问题。如无法立即升级，可在 app/src/config/util/snippets.ts:32 中将 insertAdjacentHTML 替换为 createElement('style') + textContent 赋值，或对内容中的 < 进行 HTML 转义；同时在服务端 /api/snippet/setSnippet 接口拒绝包含 </style> 的 CSS 片段写入，防止旧版本同步拉取恶意载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-mvjr-vv3c-w4qv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54067.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54067.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54067.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54067.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-54067.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54067/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54067.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5963.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54067.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0461.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0460","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0460.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54066","title":"SiYuan 思源笔记路径遍历漏洞","description":"SiYuan 是一款开源个人知识管理系统，其发布模式（匿名只读 HTTP 端点，默认端口 6808）下的 `/assets/*path` 路由存在路径遍历漏洞。该漏洞是 CVE-2026-41894 的不完全修复——`/export/` 路由已修复但 `/assets/` 路由存在相同的双重 URL 编码绕过问题。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的双重 URL 编码请求（如 `GET /assets/%252e%252e/%252e%252e/conf/conf.json`）绕过路径清理逻辑，实现 WorkspaceDir 目录下的任意文件读取，可窃取 `conf/conf.json`（含 AccessAuthCode SHA256 哈希、API Token、同步密钥）、`temp/siyuan.db`（完整笔记内容）等敏感文件。该漏洞影响 SiYuan 3.7.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54066","GHSA-p4m3-mgmm-c664"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:48Z","updated":"2026-06-25T14:22:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 SiYuan 至 3.7.0 或更高版本，该版本已移除 `GetAssetAbsPath` 中的二次 URL 解码回退逻辑并在 `/assets/*path` 路由中增加了敏感文件检查。如无法立即升级，在 `conf.publish.enable = true` 的发布模式下，建议在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截包含 `%25` 双重编码的请求路径，或暂时禁用发布模式（设置 `conf.publish.enable = false`）以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-p4m3-mgmm-c664","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-54066.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-54066.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54066.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54066.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54066.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54066.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54066/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-54066.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54066.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-5964.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-p4m3-mgmm-c664/GHSA-p4m3-mgmm-c664.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0460.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0357","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50551","title":"思源笔记 属性视图资产单元渲染器存储型XSS远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SiYuan 思源笔记 v3.6.5 及以下版本的属性视图（数据库）资产单元渲染器中存在存储型 XSS 漏洞。该漏洞源于在 aria-label 属性渲染时使用了仅转义引号的 escapeAttr() 函数，而非完整的 escapeAriaLabel() 函数，导致恶意资产单元链接内容未经充分过滤即被浏览器解析执行。攻击者可构造包含恶意 onclick、onerror 等事件处理器的资产单元，受害者打开文档时即触发 XSS，悬停单元格时触发二次攻击。由于 Electron 渲染器启用了 nodeIntegration: true 且 contextIsolation: false，攻击者可进一步利用 Node.js 原生模块执行系统命令，实现远程代码执行（RCE）。影响 Windows 和 Linux 平台用户，攻击者仅需分享包含恶意资产单元的文档即可触发，可导致笔记窃取、文件系统访问、凭证窃取及持久化控制。官方已在 v3.7.0 修复，建议立即升级或临时禁用属性视图资产列功能、启用 contextIsolation 并禁用 nodeIntegration 作为缓解措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50551","GHSA-56mp-4f3v-fgj2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:47Z","updated":"2026-06-25T14:16:45Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SiYuan 至 v3.7.0 或更高版本（官方已在 v3.7.0 修复该漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用属性视图的资产列功能，或在 Electron 配置中设置 contextIsolation: true 并 nodeIntegration: false 以阻断 RCE 链路。长期建议升级 Electron 版本并启用 contextIsolation 与 nodeIntegration: false 作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-56mp-4f3v-fgj2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50551.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50551.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50551.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50551.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-50551.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c6a7b446809d20910acd284474596c0b638aab06/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-50551/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50551.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5967.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50551.json","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/c2a841d1d731e80e82d5e2592b4982bbb689ac10/memory/logs/2026-07-12.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0357.toml"}]